tachyon-blueprint 1
# St. Cuthwin's Abbey, the whole map within its precinct wall, for Grimoire's medieval games.
# Made by town/make-abbey.mjs; edit that and run it again. `label x y Name` names a place.
name abbey
size 62 52 2
key , floor grass
key : floor gravel
key L wall limestone
key l floor limestone
key + floor wood
key ~ floor water
key s floor stone block
key | wall paling
key < stair-up wood
key > stair-down wood
key . floor limestone | candle
key ; stair-up limestone
key _ floor wood | bookshelf
