key F floor tilled | crops
key G floor tilled
key H floor limestone | chest
key I floor limestone | oven
key J floor grass | oak
key K floor grass | coffin
key M floor grass | statue
key N floor limestone | barrel
key O floor wood | candle
key P floor mud | reeds
key Q floor stone block | oven
key R floor stone block | table
key U floor limestone | bed
key V stair-down limestone
key X floor limestone | bell
level 0
